p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Hardin County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 143% of normal in May to June and 46% in July to August. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 48% on the middle of the grids. Grid 17868 had its driest year in 2007 at 63%.</p>"}
